    "summary": "Implemented S2 explicit pinned recovery and sequential history-aware re-review on both actual reviewer routes, preserving all terminal work and exact reused feedback/provenance through canonical CR. Final real IPC/Git fixtures cover interruption after reuse, failed durable writes, unavailable immutable commits, zero-model publication repair and old/frozen strict-reader compatibility. Added exact immutable test-record read grants without widening design defaults. All123 affected reviewer/provider/backend/design/CR/inventory regressions and production build passed. Deterministic fixtures are not new live model proof; accepted S1 live evidence is retained historically. Timeout-policy changes and S3 normal-entry/thread/cleanup integration remain deferred.",
